# Viewer URLs get the app. Status 200 makes these rewrites: the browser keeps
# the requested URL, which the app reads. No files live under these prefixes,
# which matters because Cloudflare applies rules even where a file exists.
# Every other unknown path gets 404.html (also the app), with status 404, and
# missing /static/ files get static/404.html.
# The FAQ too, at /faq and /faq/ as on nbviewer: rules without a splat match
# only their exact path.
/faq       /  200
/faq/      /  200
/url/*     /  200
/urls/*    /  200
/github/*  /  200
/gist/*    /  200
